{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "47d755dc36465844a83480b1bfcce38c3f117308118e621979fc9aa3deba91f9", "ja": "#もうすぐステージ　#待ち人来ず", "zh": "#马上就要上台了　#等的人还没来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "104fb63f8800fbdcec1aafdeef0c56aecc0cfddc0733689d0ddf6e1345ba9c0a", "ja": "ラストはアイドル達のスペシャルステージ！\nだが、あずさと麗花が来ていない。千鶴と\n探しに行くと、二人は同じ場所にいた。\n突然のハプニングも無事に乗り越え、\nアイドル達はステージへと向かうのだった。", "zh": "最后是偶像们的特别舞台！\n然而，梓和丽花还没到。和千鹤\n一起去寻找时，发现两人就在同一个地方。\n偶然发生的意外也顺利克服了，\n偶像们就这样前往舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "604c195070b769caa2a1aaf88e7f593688d8a01728cdce6c41f939e5f60e77ae", "ja": "（パーティーもそろそろ終盤、残すは\nラストのスペシャルステージのみだな……）", "zh": "（派对也快接近尾声了，接下来只剩最后的特别舞台了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "b48f38d9eeeb0477b0253f4ddde5016565057f70dece8a8c64783258976aa6d4", "ja": "大変ですわ、{$P$}！", "zh": "大事不好了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "1b887751aa5d821dd10c9de4470986712a47a7390e8643f58df8c4cd998ca44d", "ja": "もうすぐステージが始まるのに、麗花とあずさが\nどこにも見当たらないんですの！", "zh": "马上就要登台了，\n却到处都找不到丽花和梓的身影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3d682de54e18d6e11bc4f50b09450dbe9a060a1e2c71427a4d74985aa80ea41c", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか！？\nまずいな、早く探さないと……！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？\n糟糕，得赶紧找她们才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "9feccdba5d9cf8794a1079ce8b2b3e0a8c62f63da07c0f3638aa7876ab0b3156", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんと千鶴ちゃんだ～！\nやっほ～♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生和千鹤呀～！\n嗨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "9e89f85915b99c7ef02cfbf66fa505b563cf567c1d8c3ec4b71b1a6d7cd6d882", "ja": "あ、麗花！　あずさも！\n良かった、合流していたんですのね。", "zh": "啊，是丽花！还有梓！\n太好了，你们已经碰头了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "68c7030ce25cc26858a7fa6bffe9cb302ca48bf856534fa3402980038d95543b", "ja": "ふたりとも、集合場所に急ぎますわよ！\n早く早く！", "zh": "两位，我们赶紧去集合地点吧！\n快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "17981d4d56685d8936e0a1d97afec9c0804a3b13898a91fed3b6a076456cb017", "ja": "麗花ちゃんがいるから、\nここが集合場所ですよね～？", "zh": "因为有丽花在，这里就是集合地点，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "607696ce9e1f027ca85c1c0ebd68e536f2c7791280d536907436197d5f6d9af5", "ja": "あずささんがいるから、\nここが集合場所ですよね？", "zh": "因为有梓小姐在，\n这里就是集合地点吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1fbbcdc662d90db6306af4cc3366a5d2b13a68f4d2ecb8ac658a24b8eccdf00a", "ja": "そういう事だったのか……ここじゃありませんよ。\nとにかく、急ぎましょう！", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊……不是这里哦。总之，快点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebe10e178e707535d6ee03201b96dd8f3f0774fcf9231540476027736a53c8cc", "ja": "はーい！\n遅れた分、取り返しちゃいますっ！", "zh": "好——！\n把迟到的时间追回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "64ba2bd5697cb9423e925dcc2d90ed399f81513331c4bdfccc73f72b4cf0ed07", "ja": "あ、麗花！　プールサイドは走ると危ないですわ！\n早く歩くには、こう、競歩のスタイルで……！", "zh": "啊，丽花！在泳池边跑步很危险的呀！\n想快点走的话，要像这样，用竞走的姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "f0d25e1216d64c51fb7a77ffd353580e845118e45e4aa36c9d912b0eca4cb5a5", "ja": "{$P$}さん……準備で忙しい中、\n迎えに来て頂いてしまって、本当にすみません～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……在忙着准备的时候还让您来接我，真的很抱歉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fae70fe2018108ec57b6c573862f9c9b03af38290a8d097cd0e0552352762f2e", "ja": "いえ、大丈夫ですよ。\nそれより、間に合ってよかったです！", "zh": "不，没关系。\n比起这个，能及时赶上真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "2e70525def4239ee366e00f6dfd709aff289b70e4f4ec0bb093111f7194473a5", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれで、お詫びといっては何ですけど……。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n所以，虽说这是赔礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_05_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "53b320cf46a19fc0b10332fdf09247040eca9289fc8d63e99bada66b64899b50", "ja": "今日のステージ、思いっきり頑張ろうと思います。\n最後まで、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "今天的舞台，我会全力以赴的。\n还请陪我到最后哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
